From: NodeByte Browser Authors <dev@nodebyte.cn>
Subject: [PATCH 0200] Register NodeByte custom policy keys and mount CloudOrgPolicyProvider

注册全部 Custom* 自定义策略键进原生 policy 注册表，并把 CloudOrgPolicyProvider
挂入 ProfilePolicyConnector 的 Provider 序列（优先级最高，提示词 5.3.1 / 附录A）。

⚠️ 基线：Chromium 128 ——【需核实】
- components/policy/core/common/policy_registry.cc 的注册宏形态
- chrome/browser/policy/profile_policy_connector.cc / profile_impl.cc 的 Provider 组装顺序
- chrome/browser/BUILD.gn 增加 "//chrome/browser/nodebyte" 依赖

--- a/components/policy/core/common/policy_registry.cc
+++ b/components/policy/core/common/policy_registry.cc
@@
-// NodeByte custom keys are appended here.
+// ---- NodeByte custom policy keys (generated list, see
+// chrome/browser/nodebyte/policy_extend/nodebyte_policy_keys.h) ----
+const policy::PolicyDetails* kNodeBytePolicyDetails[] = {
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomRequire2FA,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomLockSyncServer,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomAllowSync,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomAllowExportBackup,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomSyncDisabledTypes,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomDisableRendererSandbox,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomAllowJavaScript,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomAllowWebSockets,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomWebsocketAllowList,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomWebsocketBlockedHosts,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomAllowWsUnderHttps,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomWebSocketAllowedHosts,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomWebSocketBlockedHosts,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomDisableSameOriginPolicy,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomCrossOriginAllowList,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomAllowReadForeignCookieOrigins,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomProxyVlessConfig,
+    &kPolicyDetailsSiteListMode,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomLocalStorageQuotaMB,
+    &kPolicyDetailsCustomCloudDropQuotaMB,
+    &kPolicyDetailsAllowDropCollaboration,
+};
--- a/chrome/browser/policy/profile_policy_connector.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/policy/profile_policy_connector.cc
@@
+#include "chrome/browser/nodebyte/policy_extend/cloud_policy_provider.h"
@@
   // NodeByte cloud policy provider has the highest priority and must be
   // installed before platform providers (提示词 5.3.1: 优先级最高).
+  auto nodebyte_provider = std::make_unique<nodebyte::CloudOrgPolicyProvider>(
+      policy::PolicyBundle(), policy::POLICY_DOMAIN_CHROME,
+      context->GetDefaultStoragePartition()
+          ->GetURLLoaderFactoryForBrowserProcess());
+  nodebyte_provider_ = nodebyte_provider.get();
+  providers_.push_back(std::move(nodebyte_provider));
+
   // Chrome cloud policy...
--- a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
@@
   deps += [
+    "//chrome/browser/nodebyte",
   ]
